    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "BEFORE YOU GO"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Before leaving for the airport to pick up your passengers, make sure you know the following information: the airline, flight number, terminal, arrival time, and the agreed meeting place."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "GETTING TO TPA"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Tampa International Airport (TPA) is easy to find. It is just five miles west of downtown Tampa."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "TIPS: MyTBI.com has all the highway "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "updates",
            "ref": "v-update"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and local roadwork information."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h3",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "WHICH TERMINAL?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "TPA has 110 aircraft gates at two terminal buildings—Terminal 1 (T1) and Terminal 3 (T3). Each terminal has its own parking lot, ticketing/check-in area, and baggage claim"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "行李提取处"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The two terminals are not physically connected. Therefore, you must know which airline operates at which terminal building before coming to the airport."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Airlines at T1: Allegiant, Delta, Spirit"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Airlines at T3: Air Canada, Volaris, WestJet, JetBlue, Alaska, Frontier"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h4",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "PARKING"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "You should not drive into the Arrivals area until your passengers are waiting outside. No vehicles may be left "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "unattended",
            "ref": "v-unattended"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Unattended vehicles will be "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "towed",
            "ref": "v-tow"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " immediately. To avoid circling the airport, consider parking and waiting in the Cell Phone Waiting Park until your passengers arrive and claim their baggage. Have them call you when they are waiting outside. The Cell Phone Waiting Park offers free Wi-Fi, restrooms, and flight information."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "You might also want to consider using the Short-Term Parking Lot. There, you can explore our shops and restaurants before meeting your passengers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h5",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Short-term parking fee:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Free for the first 60 minutes. $4 for 61-80 minutes; $2 for each "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "additional",
            "ref": "v-additional"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " 20 minutes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "TAMPA INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT"
          },
          {
            "t": "br"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "P.O. Box 22873, Tampa, Florida 33622"
          },
          {
            "t": "br"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "U.S.A."
          },
          {
            "t": "br"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "813-873-8700"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
